# Analytics Wajib di Fitur Baru

Berlaku untuk semua platform: **mobile** (`mobile/`), **web** (`web/`),
**console** (`console/`). Setiap fitur baru (screen, tombol aksi utama, alur
konversi) **wajib** memasang analytics sebelum dianggap selesai. Perubahan/
penambahan fitur = event analytics ikut disesuaikan. Tanpa analytics, fitur
tidak bisa divalidasi dipakai atau tidak.

## Per platform

| Platform | Service | Screen view | Event kustom |
|----------|---------|-------------|--------------|
| Mobile | `AnalyticsService` (`mobile/lib/core/services/analytics_service.dart`) | Otomatis via `AnalyticsRouteObserver`, syarat route punya `name:` | Method `logXxx` + konstanta di `AnalyticsEvents` |
| Web | `trackEvent` (`web/app/infrastructure/analytics/analytics.ts`) | `trackPageView` di router/layout | Tambah key di `AnalyticsEvents` (object `as const`), panggil `trackEvent` |
| Console | Ikuti pola analytics yang ada di `console/` | - | - |

## Definisi minimum

1. **Screen**: mobile = route punya `name:` di RouteDefiner (cek
   `grep -n "name:" <fitur>_router.dart`); web = `trackPageView` terpasang di
   route baru.
2. **Aksi utama fitur**: minimal 1 event domain dengan param identitas
   (slug/id). Titik pasang: saat aksi terjadi (onTap/onPush), bukan di
   `build()` widget stateless (bisa multi-fire).
3. **Nama event**: snake_case, format `<domain>_<aksi>` (`wilayah_kec_select`,
   `cuisine_open`). Selaras antar platform bila fiturnya sama. Jangan pakai
   nama reserved Firebase (`notification_open`).
4. **Tanpa PII**: jangan kirim email, nomor HP, isi form mentah di params.

## Definition of Done

- [ ] Screen terlacak (route name mobile / trackPageView web).
- [ ] Event aksi inti terpasang, param identitas terkirim.
- [ ] Event terdaftar sebagai konstanta (`AnalyticsEvents`), bukan string lepas.
- [ ] DebugView GA4 (web: `?ga_debug=1` di prod; mobile: debug dart-define)
      memunculkan event saat manual test.

## Contoh terpasang

- Mobile eksplorasi: `explore_category_tap`, `poi_open`, `wilayah_kec_select`,
  `wilayah_desa_select`, `cuisine_open`.
- Web: `contribute_massal_cta`, `discussion_view` (lihat
  `web/app/infrastructure/analytics/analytics.ts`).
